# Pairs with TwoPartyActivation. Grants match the grantee by id alone, so a
# grant left on the granting tenant's record is inherited by a tenant later
# created under the deleted one's id.
MODULE: DeleteKeepsInboundGrant
TARGET: TwoPartyActivation
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: deleting the grantee leaves the grant issued to it on the granting tenant's record
PERTURBS: DeleteTenant

--- FIND
                ELSE IF Live(grant) THEN Slot(grant.gen, "removed") ELSE grant
--- REPLACE
                ELSE grant
--- END